---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '결제 가이드 — 중국에서 결제하는 방법';
const description = '출국 전 Alipay를 설정하세요 — 결제의 95%를 해결합니다.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2">💳 결제</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-3 leading-tight">중국에서 결제하기</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">출국 전 Alipay를 설정하세요 — 결제의 95%를 해결합니다.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Quick Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-12 not-prose">
      <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-800">2</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">모바일 결제 앱</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-indigo-800">2</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">설정 튜토리얼</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-red-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">신용카드 가이드</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-pink-50 border border-pink-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-pink-800">1</p>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-pink-800 uppercase tracking-wide mt-1">팁 가이드</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-8 mb-16 not-prose">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-blue-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-800">시작하기</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-800 opacity-60">2개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/payment/setup-alipay/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">💰 튜토리얼</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">외국인이 Alipay를 설정하는 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">앱 다운로드, 해외 번호로 가입, 해외 카드 연결.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/ko/payment/setup-wechat/" class="block bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-blue-800">💬 튜토리얼</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">외국인이 WeChat Pay를 설정하는 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">WeChat 다운로드, 가입, 본인 인증, 해외 카드 연결.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-indigo-800">해외 카드 사용</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-indigo-800 opacity-60">1개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/payment/foreign-cards/" class="block bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-800">💳 가이드</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국에서 해외 신용카드를 사용할 수 있나요?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Visa나 Mastercard가 실제로 작동하는 곳, ATM 인출 수수료.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-800">자주 발생하는 문제</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-red-800 opacity-60">1개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/payment/payment-fails/" class="block bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">🔧 문제 해결</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">결제 실패 시 대처 방법</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">일반적인 결제 실패 원인과 단계별 문제 해결.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-pink-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-pink-800">팁 & 문화</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-pink-800 opacity-60">1개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/payment/tipping/" class="block bg-pink-50 border border-pink-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-pink-800">🎭 문화</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국 팁 문화: 팁을 줘야 할까요?</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">아니요, 중국에서는 팁이 관례가 아닙니다. 간단한 가이드를 확인하세요.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <div class="w-1 h-7 bg-gray-500 rounded-full"></div>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800">종합 가이드</h2>
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-800 opacity-60">1개 문서</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <a href="/ko/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition no-underline">
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800">📖 개요</span>
            <p class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900 mt-1">중국에서 결제하는 방법: 완벽 가이드</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-0.5">Alipay, WeChat Pay, 현금 또는 신용카드 — 전체 개요.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Related Guides -->
    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-5">관련 가이드</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="/ko/transport/transport-guide/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">중국 교통</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">기차, 지하철, 택시, 차량 호출</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/ko/life/essential-apps/" class="block bg-white rounded-xl p-4 hover:shadow-md transition border border-gray-100 no-underline">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-0.5">중국 필수 앱</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">중국 여행에 꼭 필요한 앱</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
